From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrice Brissette <pbrisset@cisco.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:10:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] tests: Cover EVPN L3MH port handoff and recovery

Port the L3MH and bridge-port protection topology regressions from
FRRouting PR #24584. Include the development-only Zebra test module
that gates dataplane events and triggers timer expiry directly.

Switch to unique explicit route targets to exercise VRF unimport on
FRR 10.7.1, which derives an implicit route target by default.

Exercise RT-1 return with a retained or withdrawn RT-2. Attach peer
VLANs explicitly in the BPP replay regression on the composed stack.

Signed-off-by: Patrice Brissette <pbrisset@cisco.com>
